rice bias %, and whether price is above each MA. Also returns overall MA alignment (多头/空头/混合).', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'periods': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Comma-separated MA periods to calculate (default: '5,10,20,30,60,120,250'). E.g., '5,10,20,60'"}, 'days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of trading days to fetch history for (default: 120)'}}, 'required': ['stock_code']}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'get_volume_analysis', 'description': 'Analyse volume-price relationship for a stock. Returns volume ratios, average volume on up vs down days, volume trend (expanding/shrinking), and pattern interpretation (量价配合/背离). Useful for confirming trend strength and detecting distribution or accumulation phases.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of recent trading days to analyse (default: 30)'}}, 'required': ['stock_code']}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'analyze_pattern', 'description': 'Detect candlestick and chart patterns in recent price history. Identifies: Doji, Hammer, Shooting Star, Morning/Evening Star, Engulfing, Double Bottom, upward breakout, box oscillation, and more. Returns pattern list with type (bullish/bearish/reversal) and strength.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of recent trading days to scan (default: 60)'}}, 'required': ['stock_code']}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'get_chip_distribution', 'description': 'Get chip distribution analysis for a stock. Returns profit ratio, average cost, chip concentration at 90% and 70% levels. Useful for judging support/resistance and holding structure.', 'parameter